Replay (self-hosted)Snapshot (two ledgers)Hybrid (Formance Cloud) <pre><code>{
  "formance": {
    "url": "http://localhost:3068",
    "ledgers": ["main"],
    "page_size": 100
  },
  "blnk": {
    "url": "http://localhost:5001",
    "api_key": "${BLNK_API_KEY:-}"
  },
  "mapping": {
    "rules": [
      { "match": "platform:fees", "indicator": "@Fees" },
      { "match": "users:*:wallet", "ledger": "Customer Wallets" },
      { "match": "merchants:**", "ledger": "Merchants" }
    ]
  },
  "migration": {
    "mode": "replay",
    "batch_size": 50,
    "copy_account_metadata": true
  },
  "state_file": "formance2blnk-state/replay.json"
}
</code></pre> <pre><code>{
  "formance": {
    "url": "http://localhost:3068",
    "ledgers": ["main", "payouts"]
  },
  "blnk": {
    "url": "http://localhost:5001",
    "api_key": "${BLNK_API_KEY:-}"
  },
  "mapping": {
    "default_ledger": "Formance {ledger}",
    "rules": [
      { "match": "platform:**", "indicator": "@Platform" }
    ]
  },
  "migration": {
    "mode": "snapshot",
    "opening_indicator": "@OpeningBalances",
    "include_zero_balances": true
  },
  "state_file": "formance2blnk-state/snapshot.json"
}
</code></pre> <pre><code>{
  "formance": {
    "url": "https://${FORMANCE_ORG}.${FORMANCE_ENV:-eu.sandbox}.formance.cloud/api/ledger",
    "ledgers": ["main"],
    "client_id": "${FORMANCE_CLIENT_ID}",
    "client_secret": "${FORMANCE_CLIENT_SECRET}",
    "scopes": ["ledger:read"],
    "requests_per_second": 20
  },
  "blnk": {
    "url": "${BLNK_URL}",
    "api_key": "${BLNK_API_KEY}",
    "requests_per_second": 50
  },
  "mapping": {
    "world_indicator": "@World",
    "rules": [
      { "match": "platform:fees", "indicator": "@Fees" },
      { "match": "banks:*", "indicator": "@Bank-{1}" },
      { "match": "users:*:wallet", "ledger": "Customer Wallets" },
      { "match": "sandbox:**", "skip": true }
    ],
    "assets": {
      "COIN": { "currency": "NGN", "decimals": 2 }
    }
  },
  "migration": {
    "mode": "hybrid",
    "cutoff": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
    "reverts": "skip",
    "on_skipped_account": "drop"
  },
  "state_file": "formance2blnk-state/hybrid.json"
}
</code></pre>

Code Meaning <code>0</code> Everything matches <code>1</code> Error (connectivity, configuration…) <code>2</code> At least one mismatch <code>64</code> Usage error (unknown command or flag) <p>This makes reconciliation easy to use as a gate in CI or a cutover script:</p> <pre><code>formance2blnk reconcile -volumes -format json -out report.json || {
  echo "ledgers differ — see report.json"; exit 1;
}
</code></pre>
